WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:04.546
Diving this tomb is so high risk

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:07.680
that we're sending an underwater camera drone in first

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:09.153
to see if it's even possible.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:12.429
You guys ready?

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:14.139
Yeah, we're ready. Let's go down.

00:00:15.189 --> 00:00:16.975
I'mma see how far I can get it down.

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:19.436
Maybe I can get it right to the entrance.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:22.231
Copy. Here we go, I've got video feed.

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:24.630
Well, King Nastasen, we come with good intentions

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:25.803
to tell your story.

00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:28.023
Please take care of us.

00:00:33.135 --> 00:00:34.049
Alright.

00:00:38.810 --> 00:00:39.665
I'm swimming now.

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:42.668
I'll try to get you right to the entrance.

00:00:43.445 --> 00:00:44.169
Okay.

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:51.931
He's dragging it down now.

00:00:51.970 --> 00:00:52.678
Mm-hmm.

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:06.437
Okay! It's pretty far down there.

00:01:06.594 --> 00:01:07.427
Yeah?

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:10.398
Oh, this is gnarly.

00:01:10.423 --> 00:01:11.636
I can't see anything.

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:13.450
Okay, I'm gonna get you right to the entrance

00:01:13.475 --> 00:01:14.308
and let go, okay?

00:01:14.333 --> 00:01:15.103
Okay, yeah.

00:01:15.362 --> 00:01:16.362
Line it up straight.

00:01:43.922 --> 00:01:44.755
Did you get there?

00:01:44.873 --> 00:01:46.140
Yeah. I think I'm in.

00:01:51.204 --> 00:01:52.711
Let's see how it looks on the camera.

00:01:53.461 --> 00:01:56.014
Alright. Moving forwards.

00:01:57.436 --> 00:01:58.996
This is such a challenging environment

00:01:59.021 --> 00:02:00.044
to navigate through.

00:02:01.482 --> 00:02:03.932
You can barely see anything and it just glimmers.

00:02:05.493 --> 00:02:07.557
Here we go, here we go. It's opening up a little bit.

00:02:08.905 --> 00:02:10.923
So, that's a corner of one of the chambers.

00:02:12.998 --> 00:02:14.768
Alright. Real subtle,

00:02:14.793 --> 00:02:15.996
light movements now.

00:02:17.383 --> 00:02:18.230
Look right there.

00:02:18.255 --> 00:02:19.131
Oh, what is that?

00:02:19.299 --> 00:02:21.129
I think that's the top of the door

00:02:21.154 --> 00:02:22.614
going into the third chamber.

00:02:23.109 --> 00:02:25.020
So, this is where the king would've been buried.

00:02:25.399 --> 00:02:27.049
We are in the burial chamber.

00:02:27.408 --> 00:02:28.241
Alright, look there.

00:02:28.266 --> 00:02:30.073
That's the left side of the slab.

00:02:30.098 --> 00:02:30.660
Wow.

00:02:30.954 --> 00:02:32.086
And this is either

00:02:32.333 --> 00:02:34.403
the corner of the top of a platform

00:02:34.428 --> 00:02:35.868
on which the king would've been buried,

00:02:35.893 --> 00:02:38.890
or it's the top of some sort of casing for the king.

00:02:39.071 --> 00:02:40.648
Ah, you barely make it out though,

00:02:40.673 --> 00:02:41.334
through the murk.

00:02:41.359 --> 00:02:42.695
Just a glimpse, right?

00:02:43.269 --> 00:02:44.391
It's good news.

00:02:44.656 --> 00:02:46.006
If we know we're in the third chamber,

00:02:46.031 --> 00:02:48.911
then we know that each of the entranceways

00:02:48.936 --> 00:02:50.106
to each chamber is clear.

00:02:50.323 --> 00:02:51.080
You know it's safe.

00:02:51.396 --> 00:02:52.076
Yeah.

00:02:52.156 --> 00:02:53.824
So, I think we're gonna have to get

00:02:53.849 --> 00:02:54.841
in there somehow.

00:02:55.067 --> 00:02:57.857
This gives us good information and lets us know we can

00:02:58.359 --> 00:02:59.826
at least navigate in and out.

00:03:01.129 --> 00:03:02.842
Space inside this fragile tomb

00:03:02.867 --> 00:03:04.190
is extremely tight.

00:03:05.155 --> 00:03:07.233
Prioritizing the protection of the tomb,

00:03:07.623 --> 00:03:09.869
there's only room for Pearce Paul and his support diver.

00:03:10.752 --> 00:03:13.647
If you can find any clues that can tell us anything about

00:03:14.313 --> 00:03:16.000
who he is or where he came from,

00:03:16.404 --> 00:03:17.463
that's what we're looking for.

00:03:17.874 --> 00:03:19.554
We'll go in. We'll see what we can find

00:03:19.579 --> 00:03:21.658
and bring out what we got.

00:03:27.863 --> 00:03:29.243
As the scanning team continue

00:03:29.268 --> 00:03:30.891
their 3D modeling of the site,

00:03:32.906 --> 00:03:34.859
we get set to search the flooded tomb.

00:03:38.588 --> 00:03:39.888
Alright, guys. Good luck.

00:03:52.084 --> 00:03:54.014
They must be entering the third chamber now.

00:03:59.882 --> 00:04:01.807
Hoping this is where we find what we're looking for.

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:09.530
What is that in his hand right there?

00:04:14.428 --> 00:04:15.698
Okay, he's back at the surface.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:17.525
What?!

00:04:17.966 --> 00:04:19.780
Oh, that was a face.

